<title>USA: Esco completes Filtertek acquisition.</title>
<headline>Esco completes Filtertek acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esco Electronics Corp said Friday it completed its previously announced purchase of Filtertek Inc from Schawk Inc.</p>
<p>In December, Schawk reported the value of the definitive agreement was about $92 million.</p>
<p>&quot;With the acquisition of Filtertek, Esco's commercial sales will exceed defense sales for the first time in the company's history. The addition of Filtertek will essentially double sales and profits in our filtration/fluid flow business,&quot; said Esco chairman Dennis Moore in a statement.</p>
<p>Esco is a diversified manufacturer of commercial and defense products and systems.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
